=== NOT NEEDED ===
bpftrace / perf / trace-cmd were installed to name a futex the callback was blocked on.
There is no futex: the time is ordinary on-CPU time in another process on the wrong core.
Raising the sampling rate from 20 ms to 2 ms found it. The tools remain installed.

=== RESIDUAL ===
0.945 ms is Kontakt's cold first process(), genuine compute in the plug-in, now on a
5.5 GHz core, 18 % of the 5.333 ms deadline.
